<p>Conjures up a bolt of shadowflame that moves toward the target and explodes into a flash of darkness and fire, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">67, 90, 108, 123, 136</acronym> fire damage and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">67, 90, 108, 123, 136</acronym> darkness damage in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6.</acronym></p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>